  i toBeCalledTimes() makes the same check and works for any number of calls, so all checks of a call count look the same.
  
  i Use toBeCalledTimes(1) instead.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
  i Safe fix: Use toBeCalledTimes(1) instead.
  
     1  1 │   /* should generate diagnostics */
     2    │ - expect(fn).toBeCalledOnce();
        2 │ + expect(fn).toBeCalledTimes(1);
     3  3 │   expect(fn).toHaveBeenCalledOnce();
